<title>USA: Albank Q3 net drops on SAIF charge.</title>
<headline>Albank Q3 net drops on SAIF charge.</headline>
<dateline>ALBANY, N.Y. 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr primary     $0.12		    $0.50</p>
<p> Shr diluted     0.12		     0.50</p>
<p> Net		 1,648		    7,570</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  14,055		   15,021</p>
<p>	  NINE MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr primary     $1.20		    $1.43</p>
<p> Shr diluted     1.20		     1.42</p>
<p> Net		 17,194		   21,778</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  14,366		   15,300</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: The current third quarter net results include a $10.4 million pre-tax or $6.4 million after-tax SAIF charge.</p>
<p>Excluding the charge, current third quarter net earnings would have been $8.025 million or $0.57 a share, the company said.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
